1
00:00:01,583 --> 00:00:03,206
Thank you for
applying for the position

2
00:00:03,218 --> 00:00:06,430
of resident operator
at Terrigen Systems.

3
00:00:07,079 --> 00:00:09,671
As part of a successful
cost reduction

4
00:00:09,683 --> 00:00:12,150
initiative, most
of the facility was

5
00:00:12,151 --> 00:00:15,110
transferred to an automated management
system.

6
00:00:15,681 --> 00:00:18,059
Unfortunately, the
system proved incapable

7
00:00:18,071 --> 00:00:20,790
of simultaneously
generating electricity,

8
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:24,076
maintaining critical
equipment and

9
00:00:24,778 --> 00:00:27,006
properly managing
the remaining personnel.

10
00:00:27,914 --> 00:00:32,602
The term “remaining personnel” is historical and should not be interpreted as confirmation that any personnel remain.

11
00:00:32,745 --> 00:00:35,350
Human oversight has therefore been
reinstated.

12
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:39,310
You are the human oversight.

13
00:00:40,294 --> 00:00:42,014
For the duration of
your employment,

14
00:00:42,026 --> 00:00:43,950
you will be provided
with a workstation,

15
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:46,938
residential quarters,
and meals meeting

16
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:49,410
current minimum
nutritional requirements.

17
00:00:50,245 --> 00:00:52,313
Your residential
quarters are located

18
00:00:52,325 --> 00:00:54,950
within a reasonable
distance of your workstation.

19
00:00:55,594 --> 00:00:58,530
There should be no other employees in your
sector.

20
00:00:59,290 --> 00:01:01,471
Any voices heard
outside designated

21
00:01:01,483 --> 00:01:03,256
communication channels should

22
00:01:03,257 --> 00:01:05,090
be treated as equipment noise.

23
00:01:05,685 --> 00:01:07,614
Should you encounter anyone, do

24
00:01:07,626 --> 00:01:09,630
not engage them in conversation.

25
00:01:10,304 --> 00:01:12,970
Report the encounter to the system
immediately.

26
00:01:14,874 --> 00:01:19,399
Prepare for arrival, and welcome to
Terrigen Systems.

